Whole-sandbox resource limits for ai-jail 3.5.0: --memory, --max-tasks,
--cpu-quota (a systemd user scope, verified to enforce before launch, with an
exit report that names an OOM or pids.max kill), --cpus (CPU affinity locked by
seccomp) and --rlimit NAME=VALUE (per-process limits).

